mail_cadence.db
mail_cadence.db-shm
mail_cadence.db-wal
mail_cadence.db-journal

*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3-wal

